  (12131, 109, 'carbon atoms, like most hydrocarbons, benzene
has the same number of hydrogen and carbon', 24.349, 29.989, NULL),
  (12132, 109, 'atoms: 6 and 6. 
What strange molecular structure could let', 29.989, 34.110, NULL),
  (12133, 109, 'these atoms fit together?
